# Modelfile for the Ollama tags of Bev (richardyoung/bev). Build with:
#   ollama create richardyoung/bev:Q8_0 -f cards/Modelfile     (run from the repository root, with the GGUF in gguf/)
# The template passes the prompt through untouched: the scorers (ask_bev.py, score_ollama.py, bev.py) send the
# exact decision prompt in raw mode and read the option probabilities. Bev is not a chat model.
FROM ../gguf/Bev-9B-inverted-Q8_0.gguf
TEMPLATE {{ .Prompt }}
PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
LICENSE """Apache-2.0. Bev is built on Qwen3.5-9B (Apache-2.0) and on the Bespoke-Nimble-9B-v2 adapter and prompt contract from Bespoke Labs (Apache-2.0). She is a decision model that is wrong on purpose, a joke and a test fixture: do not use her to make decisions. Not affiliated with TypeSafe AI or Bespoke Labs."""
